## 📘 `docs/integration-guide.md` – Add to Existing Pipelines

```markdown
# Integrating Pipeline-Project with Your Jenkins Pipeline

## 🔌 Jenkins Pipeline Integration Options

### ✅ Option 1: Standalone Security Pipeline
Create a new Jenkins job and point it to this repo. Use `integrations/Jenkins/security-only.Jenkinsfile` to scan your existing source or Docker images.

### ✅ Option 2: Add to Existing Jenkinsfile

Copy-paste any of these snippets from `integrations/Jenkins/snippets/` into your existing pipeline:

```groovy
stage('Scan: Trivy') {
  steps {
    dir('app') {
      bat 'powershell ../scripts/trivy.ps1'
    }
  }
}
